# Search scope for ripgrep-based tools (coding agents' Grep/Glob). Git does
# not read this file. These paths are generated output, vendored code or data
# blobs: a search hit in them is noise. Read a file here by its path, or pass
# --no-ignore, when you really need it.

# generated / scratch output
mf-harness-*/
scratch/
tmp/
bench/
output/
dataset/
.model-backups/
desktop/web/
desktop/src-tauri/target/

# vendored third-party code
vendor/

# data blobs (one hit is a multi-KB line)
js/icon_themes/
js/iso286_data.js
package-lock.json
perf-*.json
survey-assets.json

# reference data the tests compare against; the .md notes stay searchable
artifacts/**/*.json
artifacts/**/*.step
artifacts/**/*.svg
artifacts/**/*.png
artifacts/**/*.jpg
artifacts/**/*.gcode
artifacts/**/*.mforge
